title: "Editing a macro: current behavior"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Breaks SavedMeansDurable
    lg1: Breaks MemoryMeansDurable in some cases
    lg2: Path to the MemoryMeansDurable or SavedMeansDurable bug
  }
  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 mayBreak
  class lg2 bugPath
  s0: Library matches editor
  s1: Unsaved changes
  s2: Save failed
  s3: Editor appears saved but differs from disk
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: edit
  s1 --> s0: save succeeds
  s1 --> s2: save fails
  s2 --> s3: discard changes
  s3 --> s1: edit
  s2 --> s0: discard changes
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 mayBreak
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 breaks
  class s3 bugPath
